{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1278","name":"利文斯通博士【冒险家】","desc":"利文斯通博士【冒险家】","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/01/29/288180982/12467418778d9a0c2caf58ef4bc0db1f_8003322694452214608.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"利文斯通博士","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"女\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"风啸山坡达达乌帕谷中部\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"职业\",\"value\":[\"冒险家\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"「艾迪丝博士的货运请求」；「利文斯通博士的货运请求」；「探索剑冢封印」\"]}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"编者注\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e（对不起，我还有别的事要做）\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/01/29/288180982/d7e41b5d28a194f5404a2099cf76451c_2970271745545345058.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"NPC截图\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/11/29/75053138/541cc8a4cf1456b66092413fb59782d5_4345292041488887392.png\"},{\"tab_name\":\"位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/01/29/288180982/4cded622abea61ba79928eee47a12e18_6557742568513857496.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"商品列表","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e嗯？不好意思，自顾自想得有点出神了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【关于剑冢⋯】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e什么⋯你已经解开剑冢的封印了？！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e那些丘丘人部落⋯也都被你解决了吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【没错。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e想不到你也是这样充满进取心和智慧，尤其不乏力量的冒险家！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e感谢你达成了我没有做到的成就，但我还会留在这里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e这座剑冢还有太多的谜团等待被揭开，\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e我想，解开久远的谜题，是我作为冒险家与学者的义务，所以我还会在这里继续研究的！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【再见。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e注意安全哦！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e【你是冒险家吗？】——获得「冒险家的经验」×3\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e对呀，在别人看来我更像学者一些吧⋯不过我的主业确实是冒险家。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e这是近期我研究剑冢的一些笔记，希望能对你有所帮助。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.7;\\\"\u003e冒险家就是要互相帮助嘛，向着星辰与深渊！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\",\"list\":[]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1212","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1699536126","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"6